            "Name": "Artistic Urge",
            "Desc": "BASIC ATTACK: \nAn attack with up to 5 sequences that deals <@ba.cryst>Cryo DMG</>. As the controlled operator, <#ba.lastcombo>Final Strike</> also deals <@ba.poise>18</> Stagger. \n\nDIVE ATTACK: \nBasic attack performed in mid-air becomes a dive attack that deals <@ba.cryst>Cryo DMG</> to nearby enemies. \n\nFINISHER: \nBasic attack performed near a Staggered enemy becomes a finisher that deals massive <@ba.cryst>Cryo DMG</> and recovers some SP.",
